  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed single storey rear extension by reason of its excessive depth would have an overbearing effect upon the adjoining property No. 128 Bramley Road, through loss of light and outlook detrimental to the amenities of the adjoining neighbouring occupiers. Additionally, the excessive depth of the single storey rear extension would be out of keeping and character with the surrounding form and pattern of development, contrary to Policy D4 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010) and Policies DMD8, DMD11 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014) and National Planning Policy Framework (2021).",
    "The proposed front extension, by reason of its siting, scale and height would appear visually intrusive, overly dominant, incongruous and out of keeping with the character and appearance of the property and the surrounding area, contrary to Policy D4 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010) and Policies DMD6, DMD8 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014) and National Planning Policy Framework (2021)\r"
